  "helpFaq1Q": "How do I accept an order?",
  "helpFaq1A": "When a new order arrives, it appears in your Dashboard under \"New Incoming Orders\". Tap \"Accept\" to confirm it, or \"Reject\" if you are unable to fulfil it. Accepted orders move to the Active tab in Orders.",
  "helpFaq2Q": "How do payouts work?",
  "helpFaq2A": "LNDRY processes vendor payouts every 7 days. After deducting the platform fee (₹15 per order) and GST, the remaining amount is transferred to your registered bank account via NEFT/IMPS.",
  "helpFaq3Q": "How do I change my working hours?",
  "helpFaq3A": "Go to Profile → Pickup Slots (or Quick Actions → Slots on Dashboard). Here you can add, edit, or remove time slots for each day of the week. You can also enable/disable individual slots.",
  "helpFaq4Q": "How do I contact the customer?",
  "helpFaq4A": "Open the Order Details page for the specific order. You will see the customer's name and a \"Call Customer\" button that dials them directly. Note: the customer's full phone number is masked for privacy until the order is accepted.",
  "helpFaq5Q": "What does \"Pending\" status mean?",
  "helpFaq5A": "Pending orders are new orders placed by customers that are waiting for your acceptance. You have a time window to accept or reject them. After the window expires, they are auto-rejected.",
  "helpFaq6Q": "How do I update garment prices?",
  "helpFaq6A": "Navigate to Profile → Garment Pricing or use the Catalogue tab. Select a service, then add/edit/delete individual garment rates. Changes take effect immediately for new orders.",
  "helpFaq7Q": "Can I manage multiple employees?",
  "helpFaq7A": "Yes. Go to Profile → Staff Management. You can add employees, assign roles (Manager, Washer, Ironer, Packer), set permissions, toggle their active status, and reset their passwords.",
  "helpFaq8Q": "What is the platform fee?",
  "helpFaq8A": "LNDRY charges a platform fee of ₹15 per order for connecting you with customers, payment processing, and operational support. GST at 18% applies on the platform fee only.",
